    .aria-label = Scroll to next settings tabs
pref-intro-general-title = Get connected
pref-intro-general-description = Select your default provider and check the local setup. General environment variables apply to every provider.
pref-intro-claude-title = Claude Code
pref-intro-claude-description = Use your existing CLI login or set ANTHROPIC_API_KEY below. CLI paths are saved per device; leave the path empty to auto-detect.
pref-intro-codex-title = Codex
pref-intro-codex-description = Use your existing CLI login or set OPENAI_API_KEY below. Choose WSL only for a CLI installed inside Windows Subsystem for Linux.
pref-intro-deepseek-title = DeepSeek Harness
pref-intro-deepseek-description = Set DEEPSEEK_API_KEY below. The headless CLI requires Node.js 24 or newer. Provider variables override the general environment.
pref-intro-mcp-title = Connect research tools
pref-intro-mcp-description = Zotero MCP gives the assistant access to your library. Add external tools with stdio, Streamable HTTP or legacy SSE, then test their connection.
pref-intro-skills-title = Research workflows
pref-intro-skills-description = Enable built-in workflows or import your own instructions. Review imported skills before enabling them; use the match test to check when they activate.
pref-intro-diagnostics-title = Connection diagnostics
pref-intro-diagnostics-description = Refresh service status, restart runtimes, or export logs to investigate connection problems.
